    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/2b4e0b8803f9fa93ab58371a60856eb8.avif?t=1730863099\" width=700 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/6c74c38f06d817563e59a3f7dba82992.poster.avif?t=1730863099\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/6c74c38f06d817563e59a3f7dba82992.webm?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/6c74c38f06d817563e59a3f7dba82992.mp4?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Fine Body Needs Fine-Tuning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the relentless and violent battles with Tentamon, Kajun-chan needs some maintenance. Dive into the role of an engineer and help perfect her body's mechanisms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/dd94e186cfbe955fa482b798712ff90b.poster.avif?t=1730863099\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/dd94e186cfbe955fa482b798712ff90b.webm?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/dd94e186cfbe955fa482b798712ff90b.mp4?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udebf Wash &amp; Scrub Off All the Dirt!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join in on the fun of Kajun-chan's bath time, but be prepared to do the scrubbing! The better your scrubbing skills, the more of Kajun you'll get to wash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/a223fa5d849c0b8c9dd9a3211e486946.poster.avif?t=1730863099\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/a223fa5d849c0b8c9dd9a3211e486946.webm?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/a223fa5d849c0b8c9dd9a3211e486946.mp4?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Kajun-chan costumes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a wide range of Kajun-chan 's costume from her unlockable wardrobe! or just in the mood of wear nothing at all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5And More to Come in Future Updates!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1fEarn G-points to Unlock Rewards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redeem the G-points earned from mini-games to access your rewards! Explore different areas where you can enjoy your winnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Model Viewer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and deploy holograms of both your enemies and characters from Shred &amp; Tear for a closer and dynamic look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Music Box!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taste the intense blend of blood and metal in the adrenaline-fueled beats of Shred &amp; Tear, a collection of songs uniquely composed for Kajun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Reward Picture Shelf!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the diverse Shred &amp; Tear Omake Comic series, where you'll discover insights into the game's lore, enjoy fascinating tidbits, and access exclusive illustrations and wallpapers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 New Photo Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancing the photo mode from the prototype demo, you can now set Kajun in various animated poses. Expect more options for clothing and animations in future updates!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/2b4e0b8803f9fa93ab58371a60856eb8.avif?t=1730863099\" width=700 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/6c74c38f06d817563e59a3f7dba82992.poster.avif?t=1730863099\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/6c74c38f06d817563e59a3f7dba82992.webm?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/6c74c38f06d817563e59a3f7dba82992.mp4?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Fine Body Needs Fine-Tuning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the relentless and violent battles with Tentamon, Kajun-chan needs some maintenance. Dive into the role of an engineer and help perfect her body's mechanisms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/dd94e186cfbe955fa482b798712ff90b.poster.avif?t=1730863099\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/dd94e186cfbe955fa482b798712ff90b.webm?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/dd94e186cfbe955fa482b798712ff90b.mp4?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udebf Wash &amp; Scrub Off All the Dirt!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join in on the fun of Kajun-chan's bath time, but be prepared to do the scrubbing! The better your scrubbing skills, the more of Kajun you'll get to wash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/a223fa5d849c0b8c9dd9a3211e486946.poster.avif?t=1730863099\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/a223fa5d849c0b8c9dd9a3211e486946.webm?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/a223fa5d849c0b8c9dd9a3211e486946.mp4?t=1730863099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Kajun-chan costumes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a wide range of Kajun-chan 's costume from her unlockable wardrobe! or just in the mood of wear nothing at all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5And More to Come in Future Updates!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1fEarn G-points to Unlock Rewards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redeem the G-points earned from mini-games to access your rewards! Explore different areas where you can enjoy your winnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Model Viewer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and deploy holograms of both your enemies and characters from Shred &amp; Tear for a closer and dynamic look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Music Box!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taste the intense blend of blood and metal in the adrenaline-fueled beats of Shred &amp; Tear, a collection of songs uniquely composed for Kajun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Reward Picture Shelf!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the diverse Shred &amp; Tear Omake Comic series, where you'll discover insights into the game's lore, enjoy fascinating tidbits, and access exclusive illustrations and wallpapers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 New Photo Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancing the photo mode from the prototype demo, you can now set Kajun in various animated poses. Expect more options for clothing and animations in future updates!</p>",
    "short_description": "A little collection of mini-games with Kajun-chan. You get an up-close and personal look at Kajun-chan's daily routine in this unique sandbox module from changing clothes, photo shooting with custom posing &amp; dancing and even help Kajun-chan shower !",
